diagram-design (https://github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design, version 2.6, commit 7a12007)

Used in this kit (2026-10-22, kit v11, the engine-adopt build): nothing is vendored. Two things are derived from it:
  - kit/hf/diagram.js, HF.diagram.verify: a JavaScript port of the connector and label checks in its
    scripts/verify-geometry.py (diagonal segments, runs along a box border, ports near a corner, shared ports, stacked
    connectors, label masks under a box), thresholds scaled x2.75 for a 1080p frame;
  - kit/hf/diagram.js style "flat" and kit/refs/DIAGRAMS.md: its style guide, connector rules, complexity budgets,
    semantic routing and motion spec, restated in our own words and re-drawn for video on the whitespace look.
Its fonts, icons, brand logos, templates and scripts are not used. The licence below covers the ported code.

